<p class="lead">Last updated: 18 October 2026</p>
<ul>
<li>LiveBridge is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. Use it at your own risk.</li>
<li>You are responsible for following the rules of TikTok, YouTube and Google when you use it, including their terms of service.</li>
<li>LiveBridge is not affiliated with or endorsed by TikTok, YouTube, Google or the OBS Project. All names and logos belong to their owners.</li>
<li>Platforms can change how their data works at any time, so some features may stop working without notice.</li>
<li>To stop using LiveBridge, press Disconnect in Settings and uninstall the plugin. See the <a href={base+"privacy/"}>Privacy Policy</a> for what is stored.</li>
</ul>
</main>
</Base>
